{
  "key": 1026,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_MayIGoWithYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, my name’s Cheryl.\n",
        "And you are...?\r",
        "OK, so your name is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "I’m sincerely glad to meet you.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, may I ask a big favor\n",
        "of you?\r",
        "I want to get through this forest,\n",
        "but I’m afraid of doing it alone.\r",
        "I’ve heard that there is a sinister\n",
        "group of people called Team Galactic\f",
        "about.\r",
        "I think there’d be safety in numbers.\n",
        "Please, may I go through with you?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bonjour, mon nom est Sara.\n",
        "Et tu es...?\r",
        "OK, alors tu t’appelles {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Enchantée de te rencontrer.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, puis-je te demander un\n",
        "grand service?\r",
        "Je voudrais traverser cette forêt,\n",
        "mais j’ai peur d’y aller seule.\r",
        "On m’a dit qu’il y avait un groupe de\n",
        "sinistres individus appelés la Team\f",
        "Galaxie par là-bas.\r",
        "L’union fait la force... S’il te plaît,\n",
        "je peux traverser avec toi?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_PlayerDecidedToGoWithCheryl",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} decided to go with\n",
        "Cheryl!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} décide d’aller avec Sara!"
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_IllKeepPokemonHealthy",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: I’ll keep your Pokémon\n",
        "in perfect health."
      ],
      "fr_FR": "Sara: Je soignerai tes Pokémon."
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_LetsGetThroughForestTogether",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: Oh, hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "I’ve been waiting like I said.\r",
        "Let’s get through this forest\n",
        "together.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sara: Oh, salut, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Comme promis, j’ai attendu.\r",
        "Traversons cette forêt ensemble.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_IllWaitHereForYouThen",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: Oh? Are you going back?\n",
        "I’ll wait here for you, then.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sara: Oh? Tu reviens, non?\n",
        "Je vais t’attendre ici, alors.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_ThankYouSoMuch",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: Oh! There’s the exit!\n",
        "I’m so relieved... We finally got here.\r",
        "I would’ve never been able to get\n",
        "through this by myself.\r",
        "Thank you so much, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sara: Oh! Voilà la sortie!\n",
        "Je suis soulagée... On a réussi.\r",
        "Je n’aurais jamais pu traverser ça\n",
        "toute seule.\r",
        "Merci beaucoup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_TokenOfAppreciation",
      "en_US": [
        "This is my token of appreciation.\n",
        "Please accept it!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tiens, prends ça en guise de\n",
        "remerciement!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_ImSureWellMeetAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m sure we’ll meet again somewhere!\n",
        "Bye for now!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je suis sûre qu’on se reverra!\n",
        "A bientôt!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_OldChateauAhead",
      "en_US": [
        "Cheryl: There is an Old Chateau ahead.\r",
        "No one lives there now.\n",
        "They say it’s haunted."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sara: Il y a un Vieux Château, par là.\r",
        "Plus personne n’y vit de nos jours.\n",
        "On raconte qu’il est hanté."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_ImSearchingForBugPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m searching for bug Pokémon so I can\n",
        "win at the Eterna Gym.\r",
        "Bug Pokémon are great, you know?\n",
        "They grow really fast!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je cherche des Pokémon de type\n",
        "Insecte pour gagner à l’Arène\f",
        "de Vestigion.\r",
        "Ce sont des Pokémon formidables!\n",
        "Ils grandissent super vite."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_RockIsCoveredInMoss",
      "en_US": [
        "The rock is covered in moss.\n",
        "It feels pleasantly cool."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le rocher est couvert de mousse.\n",
        "Il est agréablement frais."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_WereYouIngriguedByRumors",
      "en_US": [
        "Gardenia: Hiya! Were you intrigued\n",
        "by the rumors going around, too?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Flo: Salut! Les rumeurs qui\n",
        "courent t’intriguent, toi aussi?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_GhostPokemonOfOldChateau",
      "en_US": [
        "You know, people’ve been talking about\n",
        "the ghost Pokémon of the Old Chateau.\r",
        "I’ve been hearing rumors about\n",
        "sinister shadows, too.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu sais, les gens parlent beaucoup\n",
        "des Pokémon de type Spectre du\f",
        "Vieux Château.\r",
        "J’ai entendu parler de sinistres\n",
        "ombres.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_GoodLuckWithInvestigation",
      "en_US": [
        "I should check it out myself, but\n",
        "going in there is...\r",
        "...Well, you know, being that I’m\n",
        "a Gym Leader, I’m always busy.\r",
        "So, since I’m so busy, I can’t go in.\n",
        "It’s not because I’m s-scared!\r",
        "S-so, good luck with your\n",
        "investigation!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je devrais aller vérifier moi-même, mais\n",
        "aller là-bas...\r",
        "Quand on est Champion d’Arène, on est\n",
        "toujours occupé.\r",
        "Et c’est pour ça que je ne peux pas y\n",
        "aller. J-Je n’ai pas p-peur!\r",
        "A-Alors, bonne chance dans ton\n",
        "enquête!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_SignEternaForest",
      "en_US": [
        "The Eterna Forest\n",
        "Where Time Flows Eternally"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Forêt de Vestigion\n",
        "Où le temps s’écoule éternellement"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaForest_Text_TrainerTipsItemsOnGround",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips!\r",
        "In forests and caves, there are many\n",
        "items on the ground that cannot be\f",
        "seen in the murky darkness.\r",
        "Take the time to search carefully!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Conseils aux Dresseurs\r",
        "Dans les forêts et les grottes, il y a\n",
        "beaucoup d’objets au sol qui ne sont\f",
        "pas visibles à cause de l’obscurité.\r",
        "Prenez le temps de les chercher!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}